# Never upload the Python virtualenv.
#
# It is ~900MB of nothing the site needs, and it contains venv/bin/python — a
# symlink pointing outside the project root. Turbopack walked into it while
# resolving @ffmpeg-installer's computed require and the build died with
# "Symlink venv/bin/python is invalid, it points out of the filesystem root",
# blaming the route that triggered the walk rather than the symlink.
#
# Excluding it here fixes the upload cost and removes the landmine for whatever
# resolves a directory next.
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local scratch that has no business in a deployment.
experiments/
